{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（5日）上午8時44分，警方接獲一名司機報案，指駛至西貢公路近電訊盈科電話機房對開時，發現一輛的士與私家車相撞，其中一名司機懷疑昏迷。</p><p>救援人員到場，發現所有人均清醒，私家車司機報稱肩膀痛，由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理。現場可見，的士車頭嚴重損毀變形，零件散落一地，私家車右邊車頭亦遭撞毀。警方正調查意外成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"的士車頭嚴重損毀變形。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150376299840671744462798.jpeg/2q_4s1pokxry3ypCja2-qAdzQapSFEy8ooaQxYeGkMU\"/><figcaption>的士車頭嚴重損毀變形。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"的士零件散落一地。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150376296539623424726981.jpeg/bdkj2v5iRifqt3l0oiDgxhoaO1uUrs0XuBp4H50aeB8\"/><figcaption>的士零件散落一地。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車右邊車頭遭撞毀。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150376293683171328019254.jpeg/Yd9ZL2JY_tFG3nv7jpJdl12-73rTPwWTjYS2H6iEth8\"/><figcaption>私家車右邊車頭遭撞毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車右邊車頭遭撞毀。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150376290805747712713690.jpeg/jd-YlGy3LvoK8hkxj5t4lgz5tDESkeXfCa7DSSyuw0k\"/><figcaption>私家車右邊車頭遭撞毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150376287995432960407691.jpeg/EAdCb-10ExSkhEeDIijTIDA8jewXXCQ_xa2p3eCtqd0\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T01:57:52.621335+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}